---
layout: default
---
{% assign podcast = site.data.podcast %}
<div class="podcast-page">
  <header class="podcast-hero">
    <p class="section-index">
      Independent conversations <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span lang="zh">{{ podcast.name_zh }}</span>
    </p>
    <h1>
      {{ podcast.name -}}
      <span class="podcast-hero__period">.</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="podcast-hero__intro">
      <h2>A clearer way to think about AI.</h2>
      <div>
        <p>AI is moving fast. Our understanding needs time.</p>
        <p>
          I sit down with professors to ask how AI is developing, what it means for our work and lives, and how to think through the questions that
          don't fit into a headline.
        </p>
        <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ podcast.channel_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Watch on YouTube <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="podcast-interview" aria-labelledby="interview-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">The conversation</p>
        <h2 id="interview-heading">In the room with Lyle Ungar.</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="podcast-format">{{ podcast.interview.format }}</span>
    </div>
    <a
      class="podcast-interview__image"
      href="{{ podcast.interview.url }}"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      aria-label="Watch the full Inside AI interview with Lyle Ungar on YouTube"
    >
      <img
        src="{{ podcast.interview.image | relative_url }}"
        alt="{{ podcast.interview.image_alt }}"
        width="{{ podcast.interview.image_width }}"
        height="{{ podcast.interview.image_height }}"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      >
      <span class="podcast-play"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Watch the full interview <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
    </a>
    <div class="podcast-interview__details">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">{{ podcast.interview.guest }}</p>
        <p class="podcast-guest">{{ podcast.interview.affiliation }}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>{{ podcast.interview.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ podcast.interview.description }}</p>
        <a class="section-link" href="{{ podcast.interview.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Watch the conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="podcast-why" aria-labelledby="podcast-why-heading">
    <p class="section-index">Why I started</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="podcast-why-heading">From anxiety to understanding.</h2>
      <p>
        Like many people, I feel the uncertainty around AI: jobs changing, new opportunities appearing, and a constant stream of confident,
        conflicting claims online. Social media can leave us with misconceptions long before we have the context to question them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started these interviews to work through that uncertainty myself. I want to understand how people who study and build AI see its
        development, challenge my assumptions, and develop my own framework and philosophy for thinking about it.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm sharing the conversations so others can do the same. Each guest brings a perspective to consider, and each interview is a chance to ask a
        better question.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="podcast-questions" aria-labelledby="podcast-questions-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">Questions I keep coming back to</p>
        <h2 id="podcast-questions-heading">Technology. Work. Being human.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="podcast-question-grid">
      {% for question in podcast.questions %}
        <article>
          <span class="section-index">{{ question.number }}</span>
          <h3>{{ question.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ question.text }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="podcast-elsewhere" aria-labelledby="podcast-elsewhere-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-index">Follow along</p>
        <h2 id="podcast-elsewhere-heading">The conversation continues.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>Full interviews live on YouTube. I also share clips and reflections across RedNote, Douyin, TikTok, X, and Instagram.</p>
    <div class="podcast-social-grid">
      {% for social in podcast.socials %}
        <a href="{{ social.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          ><span>
            {{- social.name }}
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span
          ><small>{{ social.detail }}</small></a
        >
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="podcast-invite">
      Have a question I should ask, or a guest in mind?
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Inside%20AI">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
